  "contentHtml": "<div>\r\n<div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"BORDER-TOP: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 10px; PADDING-LEFT: 10px; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(254,222,199)\">\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\">저희 학교는 지구계를 끝내고 바로 이어서 수권분야로 들어가 바다의 이용에 대해 진도를 나갑니다. </p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\">2014년은 전체를 전시장수업형태로 운영하였는데 소개하고자 합니다. </p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\">카페에 올리려니 용량이 커서 화면이 엄청 흐리네요. </p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\">틀만 소개하고자 그냥 올려봅니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><iframe id=\"ve96dpBoy88qAAByCpYYYJ8\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/ve96dpBoy88qAAByCpYYYJ8?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZlOTZkcEJveTg4cUFBQnlDcFlZWUo4IiwidGlkIjoiMGIyY2EwZWUtMmYxNS00Y2RiLWIyZDAtMDYzNTc4MjU3MjkzIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg2Mjc4fQ.ktF2PgBDZUQs3vM-HUOzwA1SClI4f4E-_Ji_jq5Zv_pvR9zrAZfireydXshrn27QJfviOBPqBBdKOON4PY27cQ&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img id=\"A_2245F935537DA02A0A78F2\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2245F935537DA02A0A\" width=\"576\" data-filename=\"20140522_113019.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\" id=\"A_2245F935537DA02A0A78F2\"></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img id=\"A_22274E35537DA02C0ECFA7\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22274E35537DA02C0E\" width=\"576\" data-filename=\"20140522_113036.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\" id=\"A_22274E35537DA02C0ECFA7\"></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img id=\"A_2311E135537DA02E11F1B6\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2311E135537DA02E11\" width=\"576\" data-filename=\"20140522_113046.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\" id=\"A_2311E135537DA02E11F1B6\"></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img id=\"A_261A0135537DA030362137\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/261A0135537DA03036\" width=\"576\" data-filename=\"20140522_113054.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\" id=\"A_261A0135537DA030362137\"></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img id=\"A_221F5835537DA032340978\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/221F5835537DA03234\" width=\"576\" data-filename=\"20140522_113102.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\" id=\"A_221F5835537DA032340978\"></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img id=\"A_274E5E35537DA03409C37C\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/274E5E35537DA03409\" width=\"576\" data-filename=\"20140522_113113.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\" id=\"A_274E5E35537DA03409C37C\"></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img id=\"A_252DBA35537DA036337CD8\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/252DBA35537DA03633\" width=\"576\" data-filename=\"20140522_113120.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\" id=\"A_252DBA35537DA036337CD8\"></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p><!-- --><!-- end clix_content --></div>\r\n<p><br